{"3817690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape 9 to 5", "steam_appid": 3817690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/9dda953f8ffaed89191b726bf809dd79.webp?t=1763576398\" width=518 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Escape 9 to 5 is an hardcore climbing - parkour game.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overworked and Underpaid.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Can you rise above the grind, conquer every obstacle, and escape the office for good?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/162c25e239243aa7b3ff3ca3a28f6e2f.webp?t=1763576398\" width=518 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/3989817fb59bef3b8d66c88c51e4d98f.poster.avif?t=1763576398\" width=594 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/3989817fb59bef3b8d66c88c51e4d98f.webm?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/3989817fb59bef3b8d66c88c51e4d98f.mp4?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/086ea47d2c4e394ed524a79bbbdb693e.webp?t=1763576398\" width=518 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With practice and patience you can make it through. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through imaginative biomes each symbolizing a step away from corporate life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to ascend from the confines of your office to the limitless skies above.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/30fe3c78fd153b820fe819d4d7590ccc.poster.avif?t=1763576398\" width=594 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/30fe3c78fd153b820fe819d4d7590ccc.webm?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/30fe3c78fd153b820fe819d4d7590ccc.mp4?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/8872ab603f198c9d60268a60bf36584d.webp?t=1763576398\" width=518 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports only keyboard and mouse. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows only. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/4fac57ca13dda987158c886decf53461.poster.avif?t=1763576398\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/4fac57ca13dda987158c886decf53461.webm?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/4fac57ca13dda987158c886decf53461.mp4?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/47b1a6fc25112d36d8fcc178ded8f034.poster.avif?t=1763576398\" width=594 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/47b1a6fc25112d36d8fcc178ded8f034.webm?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/47b1a6fc25112d36d8fcc178ded8f034.mp4?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump and grab tests your precision, timing, and patience. Navigate deadly obstacles, scale impossible structures, and push your parkour skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area offers unique obstacles and aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/6b4b4a80d39e025cf4d8feb2100a7e2e.poster.avif?t=1763576398\" width=594 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/6b4b4a80d39e025cf4d8feb2100a7e2e.webm?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/6b4b4a80d39e025cf4d8feb2100a7e2e.mp4?t=1763576398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/extras/9dda953f8ff